  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 8,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.394,
            0.056,
            0.596,
            0.073
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第十一章 细胞工程技术"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.82,
            0.056,
            0.856,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "197"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.102,
            0.094,
            0.222,
            0.111
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 方法步骤"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.115,
            0.279,
            0.132
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 融合方案"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.134,
            0.889,
            0.175
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）以 1 只小鼠的脾脏为例，需准备 1ml 分装的 PEG 混合物、一份 3ml 和一份 7ml 的 RF 10，置于 37℃ 水浴。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.177,
            0.771,
            0.196
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）处死小鼠，将小鼠浸泡于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "70\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 乙醇中几分钟，进行动物表面消毒。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.198,
            0.891,
            0.283
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）将动物右侧位放置，用无菌镊子捏住胸腔后部的皮肤，切开一个小口，剪开皮肤，但不要穿透皮下筋膜。用两把镊子，捏住切口两侧的皮肤，将皮肤撕除，露出皮下筋膜。用70%乙醇冲洗，去除漂浮的毛发。用镊子和剪刀，沿皮下筋膜剪开，露出腹膜腔，找到脾脏的位置，将与脾脏相连的组织剪断，取出脾脏。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.283,
            0.891,
            0.325
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）将脾脏放置于含有约 15ml RF 10 的培养皿中（大量采血可在这步同时进行，打开胸腔，快速穿刺心脏收集血液）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.107,
            0.326,
            0.893,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5）用2个10ml注射器在培养皿中吸取RF 10，吸到大约半满刻度的位置，将培养基慢慢注入脾脏中，使脾脏分散。要缓慢地注入，一次注入一点。可观察到细胞团流入培养基中，脾脏的颜色逐渐变浅。最后，当脾脏变得中空柔软时，用针头和扁平镊子轻轻撕开脾脏，除去残留细胞。将结缔组织丢弃。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.412,
            0.891,
            0.453
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6）温和地吹打细胞悬液，小心分散细胞团块，将悬液转移至一30ml V形底管中，静置V形底管5min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.454,
            0.845,
            0.474
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7）将细胞悬液转移至另一30ml V形底管，弃去沉在管底的碎片和结缔组织。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.477,
            0.459,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8）"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "400g"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 离心 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，收集脾细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.497,
            0.894,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9）将细胞沉淀悬浮于 5ml 红细胞裂解液中，保持 5min，加入培养基，400g 离心 5min 收集沉淀。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.539,
            0.894,
            0.581
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10）将细胞沉淀悬浮于 5ml 培养基中并进行细胞计数。一只小鼠脾脏可产生  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10^{8}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  个左右白细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.583,
            0.84,
            0.602
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "11）洗涤并计数骨髓瘤细胞。对于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10^{8}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个脾细胞，需准备 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10^{7}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个骨髓瘤细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.604,
            0.884,
            0.623
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "12）按照脾细胞与骨髓瘤细胞 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10:1"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的比例，在脾细胞悬浮液中加入骨髓瘤细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.626,
            0.664,
            0.645
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "注意:以下约 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的操作步骤是细胞融合的关键阶段。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.648,
            0.716,
            0.666
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "13）离心收集细胞（400g，5min），去除所有浮在表面的物质。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.669,
            0.438,
            0.687
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "14）轻弹离心管，使细胞松散。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.689,
            0.897,
            0.73
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "15）用宽口移液管加入 1ml PEG（每个脾脏）。缓慢吹打 10s 以温和混匀 PEG，之后再轻弹 V 形底管 50s 以上，以混匀细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.732,
            0.9,
            0.816
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "16）取 3ml 的 RF 10，缓慢逐滴加入细胞液中，持续 10min 左右，同时轻弹 V 形底管以混匀两者。用左手拇指和食指（对于惯用右手的人）拿住 V 形底管，用第二或第三只手指轻轻拍击 V 形底管（随实验人的习惯），右手持移液管加入 RF 10 样品。可预先练习，以熟练掌握滴入的速度。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.817,
            0.881,
            0.836
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "17）加入 3ml RF 10 后，再取 7ml RF 10，加入以上的细胞液中，持续 10min 左右。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.839,
            0.898,
            0.88
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "18）离心收集细胞（400g，5min），然后重悬于10ml RF 10中；将细胞置于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "CO_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养箱内1h左右，适度拧松V形底管的盖子，让 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "CO_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 交换流通。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.883,
            0.476,
            0.901
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "19）离心收集细胞（400g，5min）。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 9,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.059,
            0.196,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "198"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.44,
            0.057,
            0.605,
            0.073
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.093,
            0.696,
            0.11
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "20）温和地将细胞沉淀重悬于少量的HAT选择培养基中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.114,
            0.915,
            0.153
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "21）将上述悬浮液加入HAT选择培养基中，每融合 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10^{7}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个骨髓瘤细胞需要50ml HAT选择培养基。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.157,
            0.916,
            0.218
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "22）在 24 孔培养板中每孔加入约 1ml 细胞悬液，每孔大约  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\times 10^{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  个骨髓瘤细胞。与 96 孔板相比，24 孔板中每孔的容量较大，可以减低培养基的蒸发效应，并且可提供更多的上清液用于筛选化验。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.221,
            0.557,
            0.238
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "23）贴好标签，将培养板放入细胞培养箱。"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.242,
            0.671,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "除去 1h 的孵育时间，整个融合过程应该在 2～3h 之内。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.264,
            0.366,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 杂交细胞的培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.285,
            0.916,
            0.366
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "融合步骤完成后，每天用倒置显微镜检查培养板中的细胞。注意:培养板取出培养箱不能超过10min，否则培养基变冷，pH可能会改变。视野中可观察到很多死亡细胞，这是正常现象（可能还会观察到正在移动的小泡，这是细胞碎片进行布朗运动，而不是受到细菌污染）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.37,
            0.916,
            0.43
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "培养 7 天后，培养板中需添加新的培养基，同时稀释 HAT 培养基中的氨基蝶呤。每孔加入 1ml HT 培养基与 2% HFCS。培养基需缓慢加入，最好避免破坏完整的细胞群落。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.434,
            0.917,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "从这步开始，密切注意细胞群的生长状态与培养基 pH 的变化，因为抗体筛选实验要求培养基为黄色（酸性），并且细胞汇合程度为 25%。以 7 天为周期，继续培养基的添加步骤（使用 HT 培养基 +1% HFCS）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.498,
            0.347,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 鉴定与克隆化"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.52,
            0.918,
            0.581
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在鉴定抗体质量时，必须确保使用合适的阴性对照（阳性对照可以用处死动物时收集的血液或血清）。在使用ELISA筛选时，如果出现针对培养器皿的“抗塑料成分”假阳性反应，会对实验造成干扰，可使用无抗原性的培养板作为对照将这些假阳性剔除。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.132,
            0.584,
            0.917,
            0.645
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "鉴定为阳性的细胞需尽快克隆化，并保存在液氮中。克隆化可得到大量的单克隆细胞，并有利于稳定细胞群，剔除那些不能产生抗体的细胞（群体细胞中不产生抗体的细胞通常比分泌抗体的细胞长得更快，并且将很快超过抗体生成细胞的数量）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.648,
            0.917,
            0.709
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "通常克隆时依据每孔3个细胞的标准，如果观察到培养板中大约2/3的孔有细胞生长，那么这个结果近似于每孔有单个细胞概率的泊松分布。如果观察到有细胞生长的孔多于2/3的比例，则需采用更低的细胞稀释浓度，达到每孔1或0.5个细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.711,
            0.267,
            0.728
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 克隆"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.733,
            0.915,
            0.772
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）将鉴定为阳性细胞的培养物在相应的孔中轻柔吹打悬浮，注意避免产生气泡。将细胞转移到一个新的24孔培养板中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.776,
            0.865,
            0.793
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）对细胞计数，细胞液以 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1:2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的比例稀释于台盼蓝溶液中，确定细胞浓度。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.797,
            0.919,
            0.858
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）为获得3个/孔的细胞浓度，必须进行一系列梯度稀释:以 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "6 \\times 10^{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个细胞/ml为例，"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 / 1000"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 稀释 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "= 600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个细胞/ml；在 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " HT培养基中加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "10\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 细胞。以此进行"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 / 20"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 稀释 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "= 30"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个细胞/ml或3个细胞/ "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.134,
            0.861,
            0.92,
            0.901
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）从1/1000稀释的细胞液中取出 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "500\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，加入到9.5ml HT培养基 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "+2\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " HFCS中，可以方便地制出这种稀释浓度。这样得到的10ml细胞液，足够用于 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mu \\mathrm{l}/"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 每孔的"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 10,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.404,
            0.056,
            0.605,
            0.073
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第十一章 细胞工程技术"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.831,
            0.057,
            0.866,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "199"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.092,
            0.192,
            0.11
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "分装量。"
            }
          ],
          "continues_prev": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.113,
            0.9,
            0.175
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5）使用连续可调分液器，在每个96孔平底培养板中加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mu \\mathrm{l}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 细胞悬液。在新的培养板上贴上标签，并注明日期、孔标号和培养板的来源等，如P1D3代表1号培养基D排3号孔。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.177,
            0.9,
            0.218
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6）定期检查克隆细胞的培养板，至少7天补充一次HT培养基与 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " HFCS，如果发现培养基蒸发减少的情况，就需立即补充。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.22,
            0.9,
            0.261
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7）检查培养孔，看细胞是否如期生长，重复进行克隆，并冷冻保存阳性培养孔的细胞。最少进行3轮克隆以达到单克隆的目的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.263,
            0.534,
            0.28
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 分型鉴定以及杂交瘤细胞的扩大培养"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.284,
            0.901,
            0.324
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "单克隆抗体的分型鉴定可使用商业化的ELISA试剂盒，这样可以更好地保证单克隆性，并且有助于确定抗体纯化的方案。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.327,
            0.902,
            0.388
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "从培养孔到培养瓶的扩大培养过程需要特别小心，在转移前应先确定细胞的生长稳定性:将细胞分装到一些24孔板的孔中，至少4个培养孔中确保稳定生长，才将细胞转移至 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "25\\mathrm{cm}^2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养瓶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.391,
            0.331,
            0.409
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 液氮保存方法"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.412,
            0.313,
            0.43
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "- 细胞冷冻方法"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.434,
            0.218,
            0.451
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "溶液:"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.454,
            0.903,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）溶液 A:温和混合 10ml RF 10（杂交瘤细胞为 HT 培养基）和 10ml FBS。使用前 37℃水浴加热。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.497,
            0.903,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）溶液 B:在 14ml RF 10 中加入 6ml DMSO。混合时产生放热效应，可无菌保存于 4℃。使用前 37℃水浴加热。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.541,
            0.219,
            0.558
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "步骤:"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.562,
            0.418,
            0.58
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）将细胞悬浮于溶液A中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.583,
            0.903,
            0.623
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）在上述悬浮液中加入等量的溶液 B。温和混合，分装到贴有标签的无菌冻存管中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.625,
            0.612,
            0.644
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）将管密封，置于 Nunc 冷冻箱或泡沫保温盒中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.647,
            0.904,
            0.687
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）将冷冻箱放入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "-80^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 冷冻室中 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "24\\mathrm{h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "，之后将管转移至液氮中保存。管的位置和内容需要仔细标注。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.69,
            0.314,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "- 细胞解冻方法"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.711,
            0.525,
            0.729
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "建议从液氮中取出细胞时戴上保护面具。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.732,
            0.456,
            0.751
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）用镊子和防冻手套取出小瓶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.754,
            0.475,
            0.772
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）马上将小瓶转移到防爆容器中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.775,
            0.905,
            0.815
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）用大口杯，取  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C 水浴锅中的温水，倒入容器中。防爆容器的使用可以避免冻存管接触温水时意外爆炸造成伤害，虽然这种情况很少发生，但可能造成严重事故。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.817,
            0.661,
            0.836
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）几分钟之后，管中的内含物解冻，用乙醇冲洗小瓶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.838,
            0.632,
            0.857
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5）用移液管移出细胞，置于一个无菌的 30ml 管中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.86,
            0.542,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6）逐滴缓慢加入等体积的 RF 10 培养基。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.881,
            0.302,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7) 静置 5min。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 11,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.058,
            0.187,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "200"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.431,
            0.056,
            0.597,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.092,
            0.492,
            0.11
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8）加入 10ml RF 10，再静置 5min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.114,
            0.907,
            0.153
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9）400g 离心 5min，然后重新悬浮于培养基（杂交瘤细胞是 HT 培养基，骨髓瘤细胞是 RF 10 培养基）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.156,
            0.909,
            0.197
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10）通常的细胞起始生长细胞浓度大约为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\times 10^{5}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个/孔，加入 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " HFCS 可以加速细胞的生长。不要让细胞过度生长并蔓延到其他孔中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.207,
            0.27,
            0.23
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【注意事项】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.241,
            0.55,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 冷冻管做标记的墨水必须不溶于乙醇。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.263,
            0.54,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 其他注意事项见各步骤中的“注意”。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.292,
            0.218,
            0.315
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【作业】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.327,
            0.57,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "思考单克隆抗体技术的原理、方法及其应用。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.82,
            0.371,
            0.907,
            0.388
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(刘兵)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.34,
            0.427,
            0.692,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "实验64 产细胞克隆测定"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.46,
            0.271,
            0.483
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验目的】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.494,
            0.53,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 了解细胞克隆形成实验的基本原理。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.516,
            0.53,
            0.534
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 掌握细胞克隆形成实验的基本方法。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.545,
            0.272,
            0.568
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验原理】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.58,
            0.912,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "检测细胞活性的一个重要方法是测定单个细胞形成细胞群落的能力。单个细胞在体外持续增殖6代以上，其后代组成的细胞群体，称为克隆或集落。每个克隆可含有50个以上的细胞，大小为0.3~1.0mm。通过计数克隆形成率，可对单个细胞的增殖潜力做定量分析，了解细胞的增殖力和对生存环境的适应性，克隆形成率高者其独立生存能力强。除了数群落数以外，由于某些药品对细胞增殖可能有延迟作用，也有必要做群落的大小尺寸分析。这可以通过数每个细胞群落的细胞数、测量直径，或测定与染色液培养的细胞群吸收量来做到。这种方法常用于抗癌药物敏感性实验以及肿瘤放射生物学实验等。常见的方法有平板克隆形成实验和软琼脂克隆形成实验。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.76,
            0.437,
            0.783
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
